description = "THE BEAT: day two or three, when the coal curve turns over. The player has enough generators; what they do not have is enough fuel to keep them lit. Twelve percent more heat for ten percent less coal is the difference between a supply line that works and one that needs doubling."
flavour = "Preheat the air, close the damper, and stop throwing half the fire up the flue."
